# entry: ../main.prism
# headless: 480x640
# example-apps: "Editing the row layout keeps the list". Three items, the second checked and a
# draft typed, then a reload that changes the row's layout: the items, the check, the draft
# and the focus survive, and typing and adding go on in the new code.
click textfield
type "Milk"
click "Add"
click textfield
type "Eggs"
click "Add"
click textfield
type "Bread"
click "Add"
click checkbox 2
click textfield
type "Jam"
edit ../screen.prism editing-the-row-layout-keeps-the-list.screen.prism.v2
dump
type "s"
click "Add"
dump
